Added Gears for Both cars
Player 1 Controls:
Accelerate: Up Arrow Key
Turn left/right: Left & Right Arrow Keys
Brakes: Down Arrow Key
Shift Up: O
Shift Down: I
Boost: U
Reset Car if upside down: P

Player 2 Controls:
Accelerate: W
Turn left/right: A & D
Brakes: S
Shift Up: E
Shift Down: Q
Boost: T
Reset Car if upside down: R

Improved AI massively - they are still a bit all over the place but they definitely work now. You can actually collide with them normally now
Cars are now rear wheel drive
Brakes now actually work

